Effie Gray is a 2014 British biographical film written by Emma Thompson and directed by Richard Laxton, starring Dakota Fanning, Emma
Thompson, Tom Sturridge, David Suchet, Julie Walters, Greg Wise, Claudia Cardinale, Robbie Coltrane, James Fox and Derek Jacobi.

11
01:16:16,000 --> 01:16:22,000
It is based on the true story of John Ruskin's marriage to Euphemia
Gray and the subsequent annulment of their marriage.

12
